          "body": "**Galena (PbS)**: Lead grey colour, 3 sets of perfect cleavage, high specific gravity (7.5). Occurs commonly with Zinc.\n**Sphalerite (ZnS)**: Also known as zinc blend. Yellowish brown to black, resinous lustre, 3 sets of cleavage.",
